--request is required
Usage:
  formora baseline check [--root PATH] [--strict]
  formora scene init --scene PATH [--demo-room]
  formora scene inspect --scene PATH [--entity ID [--world] | --mesh-asset ID [--tessellate] [--selection-topology] [--normals]]
  formora scene apply --scene PATH --request FILE|-
  formora scene serve --scene PATH
  formora scene schema
  formora mcp --scene PATH [--preview] [--capture PNG]
  formora preview --scene PATH [--capture PNG]
  formora render --scene PATH --output PNG [--width N] [--height N]
